# Git and secrets

Follow `docs/engineering/git-workflow.md`.

- No force-push or merge to protected `main` unless the user explicitly asks.
- No credentials in commits. Never print secrets.
- Conventional prefixes: `feat:`, `fix:`, `refactor:`, `test:`, `docs:`, `chore:`, `security:`.
- Commit only when the user asks. Guardian PASS is required before Atlas treats work as complete.
